# AVA / Alpha Visual Artists branding

This project is **Alpha Visual Artists (AVA)** — the official mobile app and Creator Toolkit.

- **Never** refer to the product as "Vertikal" in user-facing docs, UI copy, READMEs, or comments meant for humans.
- Use **AVA** or **Alpha Visual Artists** as the product name.
- The repo folder may still be named `Vertikal-App` on disk (legacy). Keep literal paths when needed for developers; add *(legacy folder name)* where helpful.
- Do **not** rename the git repo folder, package.json `name`, bundle IDs, git remotes, or import paths unless changing user-facing strings only.
